WEBVTT

00:04:29.163 --> 00:04:31.704
can be a reliable source 
of additional income.

00:04:32.246 --> 00:04:35.079
With continued improvements
in wind forecasting,

00:04:35.079 --> 00:04:38.329
electrical grid infrastructure
and energy storage,

00:04:38.329 --> 00:04:42.329
wind power might blow away
all our energy problems.